<p>
  We locked sign-in to your account after <%= User::LOGIN_MAX_ATTEMPTS %> wrong
  password attempts in a row.
</p>
<p>
  To unlock it, choose a new password within the next 15 minutes on
  <%= link_to "this password reset page", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>.
  If the link has expired, use "Forgot your password?" on the sign-in page to get a new one.
</p>
<p>
  If these attempts weren't you, someone may be guessing your password —
  choosing a new one keeps your account safe.
</p>
